OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAColonel cleared over handling of
OL,4,Asoldier abuse case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Army officer has been cleared
OL,7,Fof failing to properly deal with abuse
OL,8,Fallegations made by a teenage soldier
OL,9,Fwho took her own life.
OL,11,FCol Samantha Shepherd has been on trial
OL,12,Fat Military Court Centre at Catterick
OL,13,FGarrison in North Yorkshire, in
OL,14,Fconnection with the handling of
OL,15,Fconcerns raised by Gunner Jaysley Beck,
OL,16,Ffrom Cumbria.
OL,18,FThe 19-year-old took her own life at
OL,19,FLarkhill Camp in Wiltshire in 2021
OL,20,Fafter former Battery Sgt Michael Webber
OL,21,F"pinned her down" and sexually
OL,22,Fassaulted her.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
