OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAColonel cleared over handling of
OL,4,Asoldier abuse case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA board - which consisted of an Air
OL,7,FCommodore, a Royal Navy captain and an
OL,8,FArmy colonel - returned a not guilty
OL,9,Fverdict for Shepherd, on the directions
OL,10,Fof a judge.
